 with the chores.</span>"}]},{"id":13030,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>When Maya was five, she...</div>","choices":[{"id":25037,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> had to do more chores than her brother.</span>"},{"id":25038,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> had to do fewer chores than her brother.</span>"},{"id":25039,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> didn't help much, just like her brother.</span>"}]},{"id":13031,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Maya thinks when she has children, she won't ask them to do chores.</div>","choices":[{"id":25040,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> True</span>"},{"id":25041,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> False</span>"},{"id":25042,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> Not mentioned</span>"}]},{"id":13032,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Leo thinks children...</div>","choices":[{"id":25043,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> don't do what they are asked to do.</span>"},{"id":25044,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> should do more chores</span>"},{"id":25045,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> don't have to do chores.</span>"}]}]}]}